# Implementation Plan - UI Design Overhaul

## Goal Description
Redesign the Consumer UI to match the original [WIREFRAMES.md](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/docs/WIREFRAMES.md) specification:
- **Home**: Hero with wavy gradient, horizontal-scroll store cards.
- **Product Detail**: Image gallery, breadcrumbs, sticky "Add to Cart".
- **Cart (SmartCart View)**: Grouped by store, savings banner.
- **Checkout**: Split payment breakdown.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Home / Store List
#### [MODIFY] [StoreList.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/StoreList.tsx)
- **Hero Section**: Add animated wavy gradient background with tagline "Shop Local, Optimize Savings".
- **Store Cards**: Horizontal scroll container. Card layout: Image, Avatar overlap, Name, Distance badge.

---

### Product Detail
#### [MODIFY] [ProductDetail.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/ProductDetail.tsx)
- **Breadcrumbs**: Home > Store > Category > Item.
- **Image Gallery**: Larger image, swipeable (simplified for web).
- **Price**: Huge font.
- **Sold By Disclosure**: Bold, regulatory-compliant store name.
- **Add to Cart**: Floating sticky button at bottom.

---

### Cart (SmartCart View)
#### [MODIFY] [Cart.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Cart.tsx)
- **Top Summary**: "Total: $X.XX (N Stores)".
- **Grouped List**: Items grouped under Store headers with logos.
- **Smart Optimizer Banner**: "You saved $X.XX by splitting this order!".
- **Checkout Button**: Fixed at bottom.

---

### Checkout (New)
#### [NEW] [Checkout.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/Checkout.tsx)
- **Order Summary**: Per-store subtotals + Service Fee + Tax.
- **Single Pay Button**: With disclaimer about separate charges.

---

### Routing Update
#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/App.tsx)
- Add `/checkout` route.

---

## Verification Plan
1.  Browse Home: See animated hero, horizontal store cards.
2.  Click Store -> Product: See breadcrumbs, large image, "Sold by".
3.  Add to Cart: Toast confirmation.
4.  View Cart: Items grouped by store, savings banner.
5.  Proceed to Checkout: See split payment breakdown.
